From: Krzysztof Kościuszkiewicz <k.kosciuszkiewicz@arista.com>
Date: Tue, 05 May 2026 20:47:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: spi-nor: macronix: add lock support for mx25u51245g

The MX25U51245G has 4 block-protection bits (BP0-BP3) in SR1[5:2].
The TB (Top/Bottom) bit lives in Configuration Register 1, not SR1, so
SPI_NOR_HAS_TB is not needed. Add SPI_NOR_HAS_LOCK | SPI_NOR_4BIT_BP so
that the MTD MEMUNLOCK ioctl succeeds and write-protect can be lifted.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Krzysztof Kościuszkiewicz <k.kosciuszkiewicz@arista.com>
---
 drivers/mtd/spi-nor/macronix.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/macronix.c b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/macronix.c
--- a/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/macronix.c
+++ b/drivers/mtd/spi-nor/macronix.c
@@ -199,6 +199,7 @@ static const struct flash_info macronix_nor_parts[] = {
 		.id = SNOR_ID(0xc2, 0x25, 0x3a),
 		.name = "mx25u51245g",
 		.size = SZ_64M,
+		.flags = SPI_NOR_HAS_LOCK | SPI_NOR_4BIT_BP,
 		.no_sfdp_flags = SECT_4K | SPI_NOR_DUAL_READ | SPI_NOR_QUAD_READ,
 		.fixup_flags = SPI_NOR_4B_OPCODES,
 		.fixups = &macronix_qpp4b_fixups,
-- 
2.47.3
